# Kyoshi Island Plaza: "When this enters, search your library for up to X basic land cards, where X is the number of Shrines you
# control. Put those cards onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle." Alone in turn 1 the Plaza is the one Shrine Bot1 controls, so
# X is 1: two basic lands are refused, so is the Tropical Island (a land card, not a basic one), and the Forest comes in tapped. The
# Plaza is not "another" Shrine for its own second ability, so there is no second search.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Kyoshi Island Plaza
Island
Island
Tropical Island
Forest
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kyoshi Island Plaza.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Search(Tropical Island)
! Bot1.Search(Forest; Island)
Bot1.Search(Forest)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Kyoshi Island Plaza; Mox Emerald; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Tapped = true
Bot1.Library != Forest
Bot1.Library.Count = 13
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island
Bot2.Library.Count = 13
